# Spark-language MITM CA — SoT is asm mitm ca-* (not Python-first).
# Dry-run: mitm ca-init forks ./spark-mitm-ca --init (real PEM under
# out/browser/ca/ + product data/ca/). ca-install plans only (never
# auto-trust). Live trust: ./spark --live + mitm ca-install.

mitm ca-init -> ca
mitm ca-status -> ca_st
mitm ca-install -> ca_plan
browser flags -> flags
mitm enable -> mitm_on
